{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_019i8LjvMbnS9zsSv9ozU5hf","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now let me compile the findings. Let me create a summary document showing the current debug context loading state:\n\n## Summary: Debug Context Loading State\n\nBased on my analysis of the repository at `/Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick`, here is the current state of debug context loading across the specified files:\n\n### 1. **internal/executor/retry.go**\n\n**Debug-related functions found:**\n- **Line 79**: `loadDebugContext()` method call in `RetryTask()`\n- **Lines 139-151**: `loadDebugContext()` method definition\n  - Reads from a debug file path\n  - Returns empty string if file doesn't exist\n  - Simple file content read via `os.ReadFile()`\n\n**Key logic**: Debug context is loaded at the start of each retry attempt and passed to the task runner.\n\n### 2. **internal/executor/runner.go**\n\n**Debug-related code found:**\n- **Line 52**: `DebugContent` field in `TestGenContext` struct\n- **Line 158**: `debugContent` loaded from workspace `debug.md` file using `loadFileContent()`\n- **Line 208**: `debug_content` variable set in test generation prompt builder\n- **Line 251-253**: Debug loading in `GenerateDoingPromptFile()`\n  - Path: `doing/debug.md`\n  - Uses `contextMgr.LoadDebugFromFile(debugMdPath)` (from context.go)\n  - Errors silently ignored when file is absent\n\n**Key logic**: Debug.md is loaded via ContextManager and embedded in both test generation and doing prompts.\n\n### 3. **internal/cmd/learning.go**\n\n**Debug-related code found:**\n- **Line 69**: `DebugContent` field in `ExecutionData` struct (stores raw debug.md content)\n- **Lines 102-104**: In `runLearningDryRun()` - reads debug.md from `doing/debug.md`\n- **Lines 165-171**: In `collectExecutionData()` - reads `debug.md` from doing directory\n  - Path: `doing/debug.md`\n  - Embeds content directly (not as file reference)\